Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: View No Display Portlet Configuration Permission
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	When these variables
		|url1|${portalURL}/testxxx/?p_p_id=com_liferay_portlet_configuration_web_portlet_PortletConfigurationPortlet&p_p_lifecycle=0&p_p_state=maximized&_com_liferay_portlet_configuration_web_portlet_PortletConfigurationPortlet_mvcPath=%2Fedit_configuration.jsp&_com_liferay_portlet_configuration_web_portlet_PortletConfigurationPortlet_portletResource=com_liferay_users_admin_web_portlet_UsersAdminPortlet|
	And these variables
		|url2|${portalURL}/testxxx/?p_p_id=com_liferay_users_admin_web_portlet_UsersAdminPortlet&p_p_state=maximized|
	And Page add
		|pageName|testxxx|
	And User logout PG
	And Open at locator '${url1}'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not have the required permissions.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_2'
	And Open at locator '${url2}'
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not have the roles required to access this portlet.' at locator 'Message#ERROR'